OL,3,GNEWSAPolice mergers a bad idea, says
OL,4,Acommissioner
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police and crime commissioner (PCC)
OL,7,Fsays merging police forces would make
OL,8,Fit harder to recruit officers, tackle
OL,9,Frural crime and would not save money.
OL,11,FLast week, Metropolitan Police
OL,12,Fcommissioner Sir Mark Rowley proposed
OL,13,Fthe current 43 forces should be
OL,14,Freplaced by eight to 10 larger forces,
OL,15,Farguing the system was "heading for
OL,16,Ffailure" without change.
OL,18,FHowever, Marc Jones, the PCC for
OL,19,FLincolnshire, said move "would not be
OL,20,Fin our benefit."
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
