OL,3,GNEWSAPolice mergers a bad idea, says
OL,4,Acommissioner
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "If we think the people of
OL,7,FSkegness or Spalding or Horncastle are
OL,8,Fgoing to be safer because the Chief
OL,9,FConstable is sitting in Nottingham,
OL,10,FLeicester or Derby concentrating on
OL,11,Fmajor crime in the East Midlands, I'm
OL,12,Fafraid they won't."
